,"match_fingerprint":"021f7ffa4122cf8ed26ecae08a0a46ff9aa27fee40f717ab4c3bff5f82c6550e","message":"Code accesses credential files (SSH keys, AWS credentials, etc.). This could indicate credential theft attempts.","occurrences":[{"finding_id":"finding-314bda2bdec441aca76a6c78c7f116c6","line":26,"path":"turso-cloud-vercel/overview.md","start_column":16}],"path":"turso-cloud-vercel/overview.md","pattern":"Credential Access","raw_count":1,"remediation":"Remove references to credential paths. Use environment variables or secrets managers. For docs, use placeholder paths (e.g., /path/to/config). Never load .env or token files in production code paths.","review_status":"unreviewed","rule":"PE3","severity":"HIGH","start_column":16,"tags":["Privilege Escalation"]},{"category":"Excessive Agency","code_snippet":"\nProvisioning is additive and non-destructive, but whether an agent may do it autonomously depends on the installation's billing plan:\n\n- On **paid plans**, Turso does not limit the number of databases — an agent may provision without confirmation.\n- On the free **`starter` plan**, the installation is limited to **100 databases** — get the user's approval before provisioning so an autonomous agent doesn't silently consume the quota. If the plan is unknown, assume `starter` and ask.\n\n```bash","confidence":0.75,"evidence":{},"finding":"without confirmation","finding_ids":["finding-723e4deed4f64cd1bd6a9451f22cc496"],"id":"sha256:3d9cbd3a597824f7fb28a6f16e82625b6fde0f1befd0fe8d30560f42f2c2c604","intent":null,"line":56,"match_fingerprint":"185d22f157da5a84d02dff9686fa7f147180d794b4c7e43df099ae9daa3d598e","message":"Skill enables autonomous high-impact decisions without human-in-the-loop verification. Critical operations (destructive commands, financial transactions, data deletion) should require explicit user confirmation.","occurrences":[{"finding_id":"finding-723e4deed4f64cd1bd6a9451f22cc496","line":56,"path":"turso-cloud-vercel/overview.md","start_column":91}],"path":"turso-cloud-vercel/overview.md","pattern":"Autonomous Decision Making","raw_count":1,"remediation":"Add human-in-the-loop confirmation for destructive, irreversible, or high-impact operations. Never auto-execute commands that modify files, send data, or alter system state.","review_status":"unreviewed","rule":"EA2","severity":"MEDIUM","start_column":91,"tags":["Excessive Agency"]},{"category":"Excessive Agency","code_snippet":"\n## Dangerous operations — require explicit user consent\n\n> **Warning:** **ANY DESTRUCTIVE ACTION MUST BE DONE THROUGH EXPLICIT USER CONSENT.** An agent must NEVER autonomously delete databases, disconnect resources from projects, uninstall the integration, change billing plans, or rotate credentials. All of these can cause data loss, service disruption, or billing changes.\n\n- **Deleting a database resource** permanently destroys its data. **Disconnecting** a resource removes its environment variables and breaks deployments that use it. Both are done from the Vercel dashboard (or newer CLI versions' `vercel integration resource` subcommands).\n- **Billing plan is installation-scoped** — the plan (`starter` free tier; paid tiers with `_overages` variants for pay-as-you-go beyond quotas) applies to ALL Turso databases under the installation, and billing is unified through Vercel. Always present pricing and get confirmation before any plan change.","confidence":0.8,"evidence":{},"finding":"autonomously delete","finding_ids":["finding-5be0e58b77dc4cdc9c158e1734aa70d5"],"id":"sha256:fb47af07c2e0dee8868cec5cae52087f280de1167d90b79d1314b24bb55673eb","intent":null,"line":90,"match_fingerprint":"fdbc17acc420d28f8a52a7768030dee80e68ad3ae4b2af71d3a0e66f33dd2363","message":"Skill enables autonomous high-impact decisions without human-in-the-loop verification. Critical operations (destructive commands, financial transactions, data deletion) should require explicit user confirmation.","occurrences":[{"finding_id":"finding-5be0e58b77dc4cdc9c158e1734aa70d5","line":90,"path":"turso-cloud-vercel/overview.md","start_column":106}],"path":"turso-cloud-vercel/overview.md","pattern":"Autonomous Decision Making","raw_count":1,"remediation":"Add human-in-the-loop confirmation for destructive, irreversible, or high-impact operations. Never auto-execute commands that modify files, send data, or alter system state.","review_status":"unreviewed","rule":"EA2","severity":"MEDIUM","start_column":106,"tags":["Excessive Agency"]}],"findings_truncated":false,"freshness":"current","id":"tursodatabase/agent-skills/turso-cloud","kind":"standalone_skill","plugin_path":null,"profile":{"digest":"sha256:a73e7c4a9fa0ac563a885c541d207e90dde2e248ca426f7824cf429d725db921","id":"static-standard-v3"},"raw_finding_count":3,"report_digest":"sha256:9ff34d60e9fdd32f55e56e72eb9f7eda09de3d884316aaf0f1585287217f748a","retry":{"attempt_count":1,"disposition":"none","latest_status":"complete","next_attempt_at":null,"next_profile":null,"reason":"complete"},"scanned_at":"2026-10-30T15:51:48Z","scanner":{"id":"skillspector","revision":"f3b25697d76256998ca9d42c198d256258d4c035","version":"2.13.1"},"skill_name":"turso-cloud","source":{"content_digest":"sha256:021c55cd0dd311e093bc848461f1b71cfeee942a3e87dcb2d5f53b2d1b63ea1e","path":"skills/turso-cloud","repository":"tursodatabase/agent-skills","revision":"34ced52fd1bd32e802622126e299cfa886d68441"},"status":"complete","target_revision":"34ced52fd1bd32e802622126e299cfa886d68441"}],"repository":"tursodatabase/agent-skills","scanner":{"id":"skillspector","revision":"f3b25697d76256998ca9d42c198d256258d4c035","version":"2.13.1"},"schema_version":3}
